sequenceDiagram
    participant A as QuoteRepositoryTest
    participant P as PostgresContainer (static)
    participant D as Docker
    A->>P: jdbcUrl()
    P->>D: start postgres:17-alpine (first call only)
    D-->>P: running on a random port
    P-->>A: jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5xxxx/test
    Note over P: later calls reuse the same container
    Note over P,D: JVM shutdown hook stops it
